  "methods": [],
  "body": "[powtodb~] converts a signal in power units (the square of the \"RMS\" amplitude) to dB, sample by sample, so that a power of 1 corresponds to 100 dB and 1e-10 to 0 dB. Values below 1e-10 are clipped to 0 dB."
}